OL,3,GNEWSALoughborough welcomes historic
OL,4,Afair back to town
OL,5,
OL,6,FLoughborough is gearing up to welcome
OL,7,Fits historic annual fair back to the
OL,8,Ftown's streets.
OL,10,FThe four-day event, run by Charnwood
OL,11,FBorough Council, takes place between
OL,12,FWednesday and Saturday.
OL,14,FThe fair will fill the town centre with
OL,15,Frides, attractions and stalls, with key
OL,16,Fareas including Market Place, Market
OL,17,FStreet, Cattle Market, Ward's End,
OL,18,FDevonshire Square and Bedford Square.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
