OL,3,GNEWSALoughborough welcomes historic
OL,4,Afair back to town
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Jennifer Tillotson, the
OL,7,Fcouncil's lead member for housing,
OL,8,Feconomic development, regeneration and
OL,9,Ftown centres, said: "The fair is an
OL,10,Fimportant part of the town's heritage
OL,11,Fand continues to attract people from
OL,12,Facross the borough and beyond."
